{
    "attributes": {
        "action": "Create a legal right for service users to talk to a human rather than AI",
        "additional_details": " Potential benefits:\r\n- preventing job losses\r\n- ensuring humans are in the loop\r\n- remaining human in our interactions\r\n",
        "background": "We are concerned about companies replacing humans with AI in numerous jobs that involve phone or video calls (job interviews, customer service). We want there to be a right to choose to speak to a human over AI, and a requirement for an adequate workforce to lower waiting times to speak to a human.",
